{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49111","headline":"木兰花 · 後主煜","name":"木兰花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓妆初了明肌雪，春殿嫔娥鱼贯列。\n凤箫声断水云闲，重按霓裳歌徧彻。\n临风谁更飘香屑，醉拍阑干情未切。\n归时休放烛花红，待蹋马蹄清夜月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}